# Never send local secrets into the Docker build context. api/Dockerfile and
# network-monitoring-ui/Dockerfile's `COPY api ./api` / `COPY network-monitoring-ui
# ./network-monitoring-ui` steps would otherwise pick up a real JWT_SECRET and
# DB password from api/.env — the default state of a fresh clone once
# scripts/setup-env.mjs has run, not something a developer has to deliberately
# create — and bake it into that build stage's layer, retrievable from local
# build cache or a registry/cache export even though the final runtime image
# never copies it.
.env
**/.env

# Installed fresh inside each container; the host's copy is never needed in
# the build context.
node_modules
**/node_modules

.git
